219518.overview:
The first versions of this port came out in late 2019 with the final bugfixed versions available in October of 2021. After two years of intense development, one of the most important games of all time, Prince of Persia, is now available for the Atari XL/XE. The game was ported from the BBC Master port by Bitshifters which has the source code available on Github.  

